{"step_index":316,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-07T19:43:56Z","content":"The **NEXUS** frontend prototype has been adapted and simplified for your **Smart India Hackathon (SIH)** presentation.\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 Live Server Status\n- **Local URL**: [http://localhost:5173/](http://localhost:5173/)\n- **Network / LAN URL**: `http://10.11.2.57:5173/`\n- **Build Status**: Production build verified with **0 errors** (`tsc -b && vite build`).\n\n---\n\n### 🇮🇳 What Was Changed & Implemented\n\n#### 1. Indian Sample Names & Suspects (12 Persons)\n* **Core 5**: **Rahul Verma** (Kingpin / Hawala Operator, Delhi), **Amit Yadav** (Enforcer & Logistics, Ghaziabad), **Priya Singh** (Financial Mule / Shell Firms, Lucknow), **Suresh Sharma** (Weapons Logistics, Mirzapur), **Neha Gupta** (Tech & VoIP Facilitator, Noida).\n* **Additional 7 Persons**: Vikram Malhotra (Noida), Deepak Rawat (Meerut), Sunita Devi (Kanpur), Manoj Tiwari (Varanasi), Anjali Kashyap (Ghaziabad), Harish Chandra (Delhi), Pooja Saxena (Lucknow).\n\n#### 2. Indian Locations (8 Monitored Corridors)\n* **Delhi** (Chandni Chowk, Rohini, Connaught Place)\n* **Ghaziabad** (Indirapuram, Raj Nagar)\n* **Lucknow** (Hazratganj, Gomti Nagar)\n* **Mirzapur** (Chunar corridor)\n* **Noida** (Sector 62, Sector 18)\n* **Meerut** (Cantt, Transport Nagar)\n* **Kanpur** (Civil Lines)\n* **Varanasi** (Cantt area)\n\n#### 3. Realistic Indian Identifiers\n* **Vehicle Plates**: `UP14 AB 1234` (Mahindra Scorpio), `DL01 CA 9988` (Toyota Fortuner), `UP32 EK 4411`, etc.\n* **Masked Phone Numbers**: `+91 98XXXXXX21`, `+91 97XXXXXX45`, `+91 99XXXXXX10`, etc.\n* **Indian Rupee Figures**: `₹45,000`, `₹12,50,000`, `₹4,20,000`, `₹8,90,000`, etc.\n* **Legal Context**: Indian Evidence Act Section 65B compliance verification notes, SHA-256 evidence integrity hashing, and IPC/PMLA charges (Section 120B, 420, 384, Arms Act, PMLA 3/4).\n\n#### 4. Dashboard KPIs & Patterns\n* **4 Core KPI Cards**:\n  1. **12 Persons** (5 High-Value Targets)\n  2. **8 Locations** (NCR & UP Corridors)\n  3. **15 Relationships** (Direct calls, Hawala wires, vehicle registrations)\n  4. **3 Possible Patterns** (High confidence matches)\n* **3 Detected Modus Operandi (Crime Patterns)**:\n  1. **Hawala Fund Layering Loop** (₹12,50,000 circular transfer: Delhi ➔ Ghaziabad ➔ Lucknow)\n  2. **FASTag Toll Corridor Transit** (`UP14 AB 1234` Chhijarsi & Jewar Toll timestamp correlation with cell tower dumps)\n  3. **Burner SIM Call Burst (Pre-Crime)** (38 short-duration VoLTE calls preceding cash movement)\n\n#### 5. High-Visibility Network Graph (5 to 8 Core Entities)\n* Clean initial layout displaying **7 prominent, connected entities** (Rahul Verma, Amit Yadav, Priya Singh, Suresh Sharma, Neha Gupta, Mahindra Scorpio `UP14 AB 1234`, and Canara Bank Hawala Acct) with bold edge labels (`₹12.5L Hawala`, `Vehicle Registered`).\n* Single-click **\"Show All 15 Nodes\"** toggle for deeper judge Q&A.\n* **1-Click Shortest Link Tracer**: Instant pathway calculation (Rahul Verma ➔ Amit Yadav ➔ Hawala Bank Acct).\n\n#### 6. Focused 5 Main Screens\n1. **Dashboard** (`/`) – Command telemetry, 4 KPI cards, 3 pattern cards, and suspect roster.\n2. **Upload Evidence** (`/upload`) – CDR dumps, FASTag ANPR logs, Canara Bank statements, Section 65B hashing.\n3. **Network Analysis** (`/network`) – Core entity graph workbench and attribution pathfinder.\n4. **Person Details** (`/person/:id`) – Suspect dossier, threat index, masked contact info, vehicle details, and charges.\n5. **Evidence Details** (`/evidence/:id`) – Custody verification, SHA-256 integrity check, and extracted data payload.\n\n*(Unnecessary clutter such as cryptocurrency mixers, blockchain tracking, complex forecasting, and live police radios have been removed).*\n\n---\n\nFor a complete reference of the project architecture and walkthrough, see [walkthrough.md](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/brain/fb69bf55-26d8-4420-a8a5-e461b2943c07/walkthrough.md)."}
